@startuml
autonumber
actor "SRE / Архитектор" as User

box "Frontend (Blazor Web App)" #LightCyan
participant "Home.razor" as UI
end box

box "Backend (ASP.NET Core API)" #LightYellow
participant "AnalysisController" as API
participant "AnalysisService" as Service
participant "GraphRepository" as NeoRepo
participant "AnalysisRepository" as PgRepo
end box

database "Neo4j\n(Графы)" as Neo4j #LightGreen
database "PostgreSQL" as Postgres #LightBlue

User -> UI : Выбор типа анализа и клик "Запуск анализа" (AnalysisRequest)
activate UI

UI -> API : POST /api/v1/analysis/simulate
activate API

API -> Service : StartAnalysisAsync(AnalysisRequest)
activate Service

Service -> NeoRepo : GetImpactedComponentsAsync(NodeId)
activate NeoRepo

NeoRepo -> Neo4j : Cypher: MATCH (n)<-[:DEPENDS_ON*]-(dep) RETURN dep
activate Neo4j
Neo4j --> NeoRepo : result
deactivate Neo4j

NeoRepo --> Service : List<Component>
deactivate NeoRepo

Service -> Service : Вычисление критического пути\n(фильтрация по Severity)

Service -> PgRepo : SaveAnalysisResultAsync(Result)
activate PgRepo
PgRepo -> Postgres : INSERT INTO AnalysisResults ...
activate Postgres
Postgres --> PgRepo : OK
deactivate Postgres
PgRepo --> Service : OK
deactivate PgRepo

Service --> API : AnalysisResult
deactivate Service

API --> UI : 200 OK + JSON (AnalysisResult)
deactivate API

UI -> UI : Раскраска упавших узлов в красный\nи затемнение здоровых
UI --> User : Отображение визуализации отказа
deactivate UI

@enduml